# Integration test classes that are in no CI suite, one fully qualified name per line.
# Used by `scripts/it-suites.py check` (PR CI). Seeded 2026-10-28 with every class that was
# unregistered at that point, so the guard only catches NEW ones. These are not known-intentional:
# most are probably tests that silently never run. `just add-it-test` removes the class's line when
# you register it; add a line (with a reason after #) only for helpers or classes run elsewhere.
